===Etymology===
From {{inh|nl|dum|donresdach}}, {{m|dum|donredach}}, from {{inh|nl|odt|*thonaresdag}}, from late {{der|nl|gem-pro|*Þunras dagaz||day of Thor}}. Compare Low German {{m|nds|Dunnersdag}}, German {{m|de|Donnerstag}}, West Frisian {{m|fy|tongersdei}}, English {{m|en|Thursday}}, Danish {{m|da|torsdag}}.

